 the record for Nance County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 227% of normal in June to July and 29% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 2012, with grid 25628 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
